WEBVTT

00:00:00.552 --> 00:00:03.431
.. UNK badarft, zogn, zeyer a WICHTIGe

00:00:03.454 --> 00:00:06.370
frage bahandl-, dertseyln vegn BRIKHA

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.089
un vegn, PRISON.

00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:11.834
layder hob ikh gezogt zeyer a sakh zakhn velekhe kh'hob gekent nit zogn.

00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:15.446
alzo, ikh hob zikh demobilizirt fun der poylisher armey

00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:18.703
dem dritn febr⟨al⟩ nayntsn zeks un fertsik,

00:00:18.709 --> 00:00:23.599
un in m-, in m- m- in mart khoydesh, dem dritn khoydesh,

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:25.928
zenen tsu mir tsugekumen in KRAKOW dray,

00:00:25.928 --> 00:00:29.826
 dray yunge mentshn un mit l- in loshn-koydesh,

00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:32.185
Yosef, Noyekh un Perets,

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:35.167
un zey hobn mir forgeleygt, ikh zol nemen a onteyl

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:38.584
in a heyliker arbet vos heyst BRIKHA,

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:41.014
vegn durkhfirn fun Shtetin,

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:44.322
oyf der g-, grenets mit demokratish Daytshland,

00:00:44.322 --> 00:00:47.292
fun Poyln keyn Berlin in Amerikaner sektor,

00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:50.928
hot men ⟨gedarft⟩ durkhforn me- mer-veyniker akhtsik kilometer durkh

00:00:50.928 --> 00:00:52.540
demokratish Daytshland,

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.860
vu es iz gevezn di sovyetishe komendatur,

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.750
un dernokh eyn blok sovyetisher sektor,

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.809
un dernokh ersht der amerikanisher sektor.

00:01:00.809 --> 00:01:03.168
es iz geven zeyer shver dos tsu tun.

00:01:03.377 --> 00:01:05.483
m'hot mikh gebetn fir teg,

00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:07.677
yedn tog eyn REJS,

00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:11.151
vayl ale zenen arayngefaln un ale hobn zey geharget.

00:01:11.207 --> 00:01:15.680
mir iz gelungen tsu firn may, yun un JULY,

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.717
dem eyn un draysikstn JULY.

00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:19.624
un ikh hob gefirt kinder,

00:01:19.624 --> 00:01:23.638
zibn yor, hobn zey gevoygn tsen biz fuftsn kilogram.

00:01:23.745 --> 00:01:25.894
dos iz gevezn a CONCENTRATION

00:01:25.894 --> 00:01:28.256
fun finef un zibetsik toyznt

00:01:28.256 --> 00:01:30.050
nor zibn-yerike,

00:01:30.158 --> 00:01:32.700
lebn KRAKOW, WIELICZKA, BOCHNIA.

00:01:32.773 --> 00:01:35.942
un, bikhlal in ale lagers,

00:01:35.942 --> 00:01:39.014
di gute malbushim fun di yidishe kinder hobn zey gefirt glaykh

00:01:39.014 --> 00:01:43.011
oyf di daytshe kinder, zibn-yerike, zeks-yerike un azoy vayter un azoy vayter.

00:01:43.354 --> 00:01:47.490
azoy arum az ongefirt mit undz hobn ongefirt

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.730
di yidishe giboyrim vos zenen geshtanen,

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.953
di yidishe divizye nokh der milkhome iz geshtanen in Italyen.

00:01:52.953 --> 00:01:56.645
zey hobn genemen a onteyl gegn ROMMEL in Afrike,

00:01:56.652 --> 00:01:58.671
tsuzamen mit der Englisher armey.

00:01:58.845 --> 00:02:02.251
⟨al-⟩ di yidishe, di yidishe divizye fun Italyen

00:02:02.251 --> 00:02:05.471
hot geshikt, nokh der milkhome iz gegangen, ende milkhome,

00:02:05.477 --> 00:02:08.857
meydlekh un yinglekh ibergetun in tsivil ongetu⟨nekhts⟩

00:02:08.857 --> 00:02:11.293
un zey hobn undz gelernt, poylishe yidn,

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.844
az, me zol durkhvarfn,

00:02:13.844 --> 00:02:16.097
ib- ariberfirn mishpokhes

00:02:16.097 --> 00:02:18.887
fun, un kinder, fun Poyln keyn,

00:02:18.943 --> 00:02:22.594
in, keyn, Daytshland, in Amerikaner sektor,

00:02:22.594 --> 00:02:25.114
un dernokh in englishn un frantseyzishn sektor.

00:02:25.137 --> 00:02:29.181
bemeshekh fun dray yor hot men durkhgefirt dray hundert toyznt mentshn.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.583
oyf mayn kheylek, vi m'hot mikh, m'hot undz gebetn

00:02:32.583 --> 00:02:34.963
nor dray, fir teg

00:02:34.963 --> 00:02:36.499
un eyn REJS a tog,

00:02:36.499 --> 00:02:41.263
iz in may, yun un JULY ho'mir durkhgefirt fir hundert tsvontsik kinderlekh

00:02:41.438 --> 00:02:44.759
un tsvey un nayntsik mishpokhes yidn,

00:02:44.759 --> 00:02:47.155
sovyetishe, vos zenen geforn aheym

00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:50.091
fun EUROPA keyn Rusland oyf urloyb,

00:02:50.091 --> 00:02:51.745
zenen tsurikgeg- -forn

00:02:51.745 --> 00:02:55.399
UNK anshtat dinen in militer tsurik in, in EUROPA,

00:02:55.399 --> 00:02:58.993
hobn zey gebrakht di mishpokhe fun zayn tsad un fun ir tsad,

00:02:58.993 --> 00:03:01.917
un mir hobn zey durkhgefirt, ibergetun.

00:03:01.975 --> 00:03:05.946
di, di mundirn zeyere hot men farbrent, ibergefirt ahin.

00:03:05.946 --> 00:03:08.516
dos iz geven a heylike, shvere arbet.

00:03:08.809 --> 00:03:12.535
un ikh hob zey, s'hot mir ⟨prost,⟩ der eybershter geholfn,

00:03:12.535 --> 00:03:13.983
ikh hob dos oysgefilt.

00:03:14.108 --> 00:03:16.357
mayn kaset iz farhanen

00:03:16.357 --> 00:03:17.994
in YAD BASHEM.

00:03:17.994 --> 00:03:20.210
es iz gekumen fun Yerusholaim a yid

00:03:20.537 --> 00:03:22.961
un er hot gemakht a video-kaset.

00:03:23.187 --> 00:03:26.179
ikh hob dem nomer do in der heym.

00:03:26.179 --> 00:03:30.195
⟨v-⟩ un zet oys az me vayzt di kaset di rusishe yidn,

00:03:30.195 --> 00:03:32.209
velekhe kumen in YAD BASHEM.

00:03:33.345 --> 00:03:40.170
di BRIKHA, hot, d- m- der onfirer f- iz geven, mer-veyniker, a yor finef un fertsik,

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.978
zeyer a, distsiplinirter,

00:03:42.978 --> 00:03:45.365
un er fleg mir zogn, "SZYMON, s'iz do

00:03:45.365 --> 00:03:48.580
a W- a WICHTIGe zakh, a yidishe mishpokhe durkhfirn,

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:52.107
vos er darf geyn, anshtat dinen in militer, du vest im durkhfirn."

00:03:52.107 --> 00:03:53.421
ikh hob im durkhgefirt.

00:03:53.528 --> 00:03:57.330
eyn mol hob ikh durkhgefirt fun mayn shtetele, vos zenen geven in Rusland,

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.625
a yung meydele fun zibetsn yor,

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:03.388
nor zi iz geven geshvangert shoyn UNK dem, dem andern tog hot zi geboyrn a kind

00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:05.311
mit ir man M⟨eshke⟩ Koyfman.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:08.996
zey voynen in Erets-Yisroel; ikh hob dem adres, kh'hob dem telefon.

00:04:09.171 --> 00:04:11.977
un s'iz bafaln di poylishe POLIZEI dortn,

00:04:11.977 --> 00:04:15.814
vayl zey hobn geroybt; s'iz geven ale d- in der POLIZEI zenen gegangen ganovim.

00:04:16.039 --> 00:04:20.758
hob ikh bavizn zikh tsu shlogn mit zey. ikh hob durkhgefirt zi, un er iz geblibn.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.692
hot zi geveynt shtark. in Berlin bin ikh geforn di zelbe nakht tsurik

00:04:24.692 --> 00:04:26.903
un gebrakht im oykh tsu firn ahin.

00:04:26.903 --> 00:04:29.688
ven ikh bin gekumen keyn Erets-Yisroel nayntsn fir un,

00:04:29.688 --> 00:04:32.630
nayntsn fir un a-, fir un nayntsik,

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:36.160
nayntsn fir un akhtsik, mit mayn froy,

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.291
iz gekumen der M⟨eshke⟩ Koyfman,

00:04:38.331 --> 00:04:40.217
vos kh'hob im durkhgefirt mit der froy,

00:04:40.217 --> 00:04:42.374
un es iz shoyn adurkhgegan a sakh yorn,

00:04:42.465 --> 00:04:46.267
zogt er, "kum, vestu zen mayn zun, vos er iz geven in boykh bay mayn froy."

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:48.984
zayn v- zun hot farloyrn beyde fis

00:04:48.984 --> 00:04:50.948
in der zeks-teg⟨iker⟩ milkhome.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.810
er voynt in Erets-Yisroel.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.486
ikh hob dem adres, ikh hob di bilder fun im.

00:04:55.577 --> 00:05:00.971
mayn, der tsveyter vos er iz geforn mit, arbet mit mir in BRIKHA, Moyshe Shpritser,

00:05:00.994 --> 00:05:04.880
⟨iz⟩ gevezn der akhter fartreter fun di ⟨D- ⟩,

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.630
fabrikn vos makhn amunitsye.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.300
er iz shoyn itster oyf pensye.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.940
er iz alt geven nayntsn yor.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.930
er iz geven in d- vald, oysbahaltn zikh zekhtsn bokhurim.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.423
zeyer a fayner bokher.

00:05:14.423 --> 00:05:19.460
un, er hot, mit, tsuzamen mit mir bakumen oykh tsen yor.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:23.232
ikh bin gegangen nokhn bafrayen fertsn teg tsu fus;

00:05:23.232 --> 00:05:26.480
er iz geven toyznt kilometer fun mir in a ander CONCENTRATION.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.668
kh'hob im getrofn

00:05:27.673 --> 00:05:31.475
un ikh bin gegangen mit im keyn Lemberik, un dort hot zi- in Lemberik hobn zikh getrofn

00:05:31.475 --> 00:05:34.240
ale yidn vos zenen gevezn, fray.

00:05:34.339 --> 00:05:38.400
vegn, vegn, PRISON:

00:05:38.457 --> 00:05:42.031
m'hot undz gegebn a paragraf akht un fuftsik eyns-B.:

00:05:42.031 --> 00:05:44.089
farrat funem Ratn-Farband

00:05:44.089 --> 00:05:48.102
mit, m- mitn ⟨revolver⟩ dort, mit, S ORUZHIEM V RUKAKH.

00:05:48.278 --> 00:05:51.730
mit, dos. dos git men t- oder toyt-shtrof,

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:55.359
oder me git tsen un finef yor, shpeter nokh.

00:05:55.602 --> 00:05:59.100
mir zenen gevezn ⟨in,⟩ fun nayntsn zeks un fertsik

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.669
biz nayntsn fir un fuftsik.

00:06:00.669 --> 00:06:02.686
kh'hob gehat tsvey yor vos ⟨far d-⟩

00:06:02.686 --> 00:06:05.487
kh'hob ⟨gea-⟩ getun arbet mit a groyser sekone,

00:06:05.487 --> 00:06:08.620
 VYSOKOVOL'TNYY arbet f⟨UNK⟩

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.528
mir hobn d⟨okh⟩ gearbet mit di hent, gezegt dem, in vald.

00:06:11.528 --> 00:06:14.186
⟨i⟩n di letste fir yor farn bafrayen

00:06:14.186 --> 00:06:16.988
iz shoyn geven, a elektrostantsye.

00:06:16.915 --> 00:06:19.778
far vos bistu geshikt in PRISON arayn?

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.961
⟨f- z-⟩ derfar, ven ikh bin geforn

00:06:22.961 --> 00:06:24.924
tsurik fun Daytshland

00:06:25.133 --> 00:06:28.918
nokh kinder, bin ikh geven a kilometer fun Shtetin,

00:06:28.918 --> 00:06:30.681
in a dorf Pil⟨its⟩,

00:06:30.681 --> 00:06:34.883
nor oyf d-, oyf der, oyf der teritorye fun demokratishn Daytshland.

00:06:34.883 --> 00:06:36.723
zenen undz ibergefaln

00:06:36.723 --> 00:06:40.210
dray mashinen, fuftsn KAGEBISTn

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.350
mit AVTOMATn. vos ho'mir gekent tun?

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.506
s'iz nokh geven mit undz a rusisher yid. ho'mir gezogt, "du antloyf.

00:06:45.506 --> 00:06:48.509
mir zenen poylishe yidn, muzn zey undz opshikn keyn Poyln."

00:06:48.509 --> 00:06:52.585
vayl in poylishn K.G.B. zenen gegangen undzere mentshn spetsyel dinen,

00:06:52.585 --> 00:06:54.590
az m'vet farhaltn, zol men aroyslozn.

00:06:54.748 --> 00:06:58.086
ABER, der iz avekgegangen, der rusisher ofitsir...

00:06:58.086 --> 00:06:59.791
im volt men zikher geharget...

00:06:59.791 --> 00:07:03.090
un zey hobn nisht gehert, vayl mir hobn z⟨ikh⟩ bashosn mit di pistoletn,

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:07.128
un zey zenen dokh geven yunge khevre, akhtsn-yerike, di KAGEBISTn,

00:07:07.135 --> 00:07:12.051
iz biz zey hobn, ver, vos, ven, s'iz gevezn bay nakht, nayn a zeyger,

00:07:12.051 --> 00:07:14.098
dem eyn un draysikstn yu- JULY.

00:07:14.188 --> 00:07:16.750
iz der yid ave- geyt tsurik.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.248
zogt tsun im der onfirer fun KAGEBIST

00:07:19.248 --> 00:07:21.810
az "mir arestirn zey." zogt er, "arestirt zey."

00:07:21.951 --> 00:07:24.892
un er hot gevolt zen, der yid, vos me tut mit undz,

00:07:24.892 --> 00:07:27.449
un s'iz shoyn geven di kalte milkhome a bisele.

00:07:27.449 --> 00:07:31.482
s'iz gevezn nayntsn zeks un fertsik, dem eyn un draysikstn yul.

00:07:31.482 --> 00:07:35.987
iz er geforn, der yid, keyn Berlin un hot tsu visn gegebn vi m'hot undz arestirt,

00:07:35.987 --> 00:07:40.434
un s'iz gekumen a daytsher yid un hot gegebn dray hundert toyznt rubl

00:07:40.434 --> 00:07:41.826
far dray mentshn.

00:07:41.826 --> 00:07:45.190
eynem hot men geshosn, a inzhener fun finef un fertsik yor,

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.766
un mikh mit Moyshe Shpritser hobn zey genemen

00:07:47.766 --> 00:07:51.071
un m'hot geheysn untershraybn... m'hot undz gut geshlogn dort oykh...

00:07:51.145 --> 00:07:53.889
un mir hobn nisht untergeshribn. zogn zey, "me darf nisht."

00:07:54.013 --> 00:07:57.040
un m'hot undz arayngezetst in a eshelon vu s'iz geforn

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.342
oto di vos zey hobn gearbet ⟨g-⟩ farn daytsh,

00:07:59.342 --> 00:08:03.629
ot di vos zenen, zey hobn geholfn dem daytsh, un Stalin hot zey arestirt in Daytshland.

00:08:03.629 --> 00:08:05.645
tsishn zey ze'mir beyde oykh gevezn.

00:08:05.645 --> 00:08:08.330
fertsn teg hot men undz gefirt,

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.480
un m'hot in Poyln nisht geshtanen keyn eyn minut. ersht in Ukrayne hot men gegebn vaser un tsu esn,

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:16.960
un in fertsn teg ze'mir geven in, dort vu s'iz nayn khadoshim

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:19.033
kimat kalt, VERKHOTUR'E.

00:08:19.208 --> 00:08:22.746
far vos hostu gedarf⟨s⟩t dos ton mit BRIKHA?

00:08:22.807 --> 00:08:26.810
di BRIKHA?, tsu mir iz tsugekumen Yosef, Noyekh un Perets

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.270
⟨YEAH,⟩ far...

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.780
in KRAKOW un hobn mir forgeleygt,

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.979
"du muzst, du bist an energisher, Shimshen,

00:08:31.979 --> 00:08:34.271
un du muzst helfn, rateven yidn."

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:40.220
ober far vos dray monatn? ir kent arbetn nor tsvey mol, eyn mol...

00:08:36.687 --> 00:08:38.930
ikh hob, zey hobn gezogt,

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.732
zey hobn gebetn fir te- fir mol.

00:08:41.732 --> 00:08:45.243
ABER s⟨'hot gelungt⟩ yedn tog durkhtsufirn nisht i- nisht nor ikh eyner;

00:08:45.243 --> 00:08:47.822
ale ho'mir gearbet biz m'hot nisht ayngezetst.

00:08:48.233 --> 00:08:50.811
ikh hob dokh gefirt, m'hot, zey hobn mikh nisht gekhapt.

00:08:50.798 --> 00:08:52.057
ober ir kent

00:08:52.215 --> 00:08:57.740
getrofn diamantn epes... f- far vos?

00:08:55.877 --> 00:09:00.076
d-, vegn diamantn iz a ander zakh. az ikh bin gekumen tsu geyn

00:09:00.076 --> 00:09:02.742
dem eyn un draysikstn JULY keyn Berlin,

00:09:02.742 --> 00:09:05.433
bin ikh gekumen tsu geyn arum tsvey a zeyger nokh mitog,

00:09:05.433 --> 00:09:08.927
hob ikh gebrakht far mayn khaver, vos er iz geven mit mir in der armey...

00:09:08.927 --> 00:09:10.569
ikh hob do di bilder zayne...

00:09:10.592 --> 00:09:13.830
hob ikh gebrakht retekhlekh dortn, ukrop,

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.702
grintsayg, vayl Amerike hot gegebn

00:09:15.702 --> 00:09:19.260
konservir⟨UNK⟩. zogt tsu mir der ARTUR, Avrom,

00:09:19.502 --> 00:09:21.500
"m'hot dikh gebetn fir teg,

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.313
un du host gefirt dray khadoshim.

00:09:23.313 --> 00:09:25.025
hob rakhmones oyf dir!

00:09:25.025 --> 00:09:27.320
for avek mit mir keyn Pariz"...

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.966
er hot gehat dort kroyvim...

00:09:28.966 --> 00:09:31.690
er hot mir gevizn aza min korobke mit brilyantn.

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:35.033
ikh hob gehat di kontsesye fun koyln in Lodzh,

00:09:35.033 --> 00:09:37.251
hob ikh im gegebn di kontsesye.

00:09:37.251 --> 00:09:39.411
er hot eyn yor gearbet

00:09:39.411 --> 00:09:43.048
un er hot farkoyft tsu tsvey a halbn toyznt zlotes a tone koyln

00:09:43.048 --> 00:09:45.208
di bekers un der bafelkerung,

00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:50.591
un er hot ge- gebitn di shmates... di dolars zenen, di rubl zenen ge- di, di zlotes zenen geven

00:09:50.591 --> 00:09:52.630
azoy vi di rubl in Rusland itstert o...

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:55.510
hot er gebitn oyf dolar, un fun di dolar hot er gekoyft... zogt er,

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:59.687
"s'iz a helft dayns, vayl s'iz geven dayn kontsesye." er iz geven zeyer a fayner mentsh.

00:09:59.687 --> 00:10:02.848
zog ikh, "se vart oyf mir finef un zibetsik kinder."

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.433
un dos iz geven tsvey a zeyger nokh mitog.

00:10:05.433 --> 00:10:09.520
arum halb nayn bin ikh geven shoyn bay der grenets, a kilometer fun der g-

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.507
fun der grenets, Pil⟨its⟩, a dorf.

00:10:11.507 --> 00:10:16.910
⟨zenen⟩ aroysgeshprungen... a daytsh dorf mit ⟨ot di kustarnik, di grin⟩...

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:20.645
fuftsn di yunge, di KAGEBISTn,

00:10:20.645 --> 00:10:22.789
akhtsn-yerike, nayntsn-yerike,

00:10:22.789 --> 00:10:26.692
un, "STOY! RUKI VVERKH!" ⟨hob ikh⟩ untergehoybn, un zey hobn mikh genemen,

00:10:26.715 --> 00:10:29.257
un ⟨m'hot mikh⟩ opgemishpet, der tribunal,

00:10:29.415 --> 00:10:34.860
un, di v- di, zey hobn nit gedarft mikh opshikn. ikh hob gehat oyf yedn medal

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:39.672
a dokument, kedey zey zoln mikh opshikn keyn Poyln; zey zenen dokh geven khaveyrim.

00:10:39.672 --> 00:10:41.790
zey hobn nisht opgeshikt. in Poyln

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:45.890
in K.G.B. zenen geven undzere mentshn. zey zenen gegangen shpetsyel dinen ahin,

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.921
az m'vet farhaltn, zol men aroyslozn.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:53.000
in, PRISON bin ikh gevezn, toyznt tsvey hundert gevezn:

00:10:53.007 --> 00:10:56.134
KRYMSKIE TATARn, LITO- Litover,

00:10:56.134 --> 00:10:57.821
rusn un polyakim,

00:10:57.821 --> 00:11:01.972
un, eyn yid, vayl Moyshe Shpritser iz gevezn in IVDEL'LAG,

00:11:01.972 --> 00:11:04.121
toyznt kilometer vayt fun mir.

00:11:04.347 --> 00:11:10.765
un yedn tog iz men gegangen oyf der arbet ⟨in, in,⟩ s'ershte mol nisht vayt, nokh vayter un vayter,

00:11:10.765 --> 00:11:13.825
un az kh'hob zikh bafrayt hob ikh gevoygn fertsik kilogram.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.895
ikh hob zikh bafrayt in toyznt nayn hundert fir un fuftsik.

00:11:17.053 --> 00:11:18.932
m'hot geshribn efsher...

00:11:18.932 --> 00:11:22.054
dort iz geven a dokter, a po- a rusisher,

00:11:22.054 --> 00:11:25.046
vos m'hot genemen in gefangenshaft zayn HOSPITAL.

00:11:25.238 --> 00:11:28.736
hot der d- daytsh gezogt, "yidn dr⟨ay shri⟩t foroys."

00:11:28.736 --> 00:11:30.482
zenen zey geshtanen un geshvign.

00:11:30.482 --> 00:11:32.840
hot er gezogt nokh a mol, "ikh'l aykh shisn ale!"

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.760
iz aroysgegangen a NURSE, an Ukrayner,

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.409
fun dem HOSPITAL. iz geven fun tsvey un fertsik mentshn

00:11:39.409 --> 00:11:41.223
funem HOSPITAL nayntsn yidn

00:11:41.223 --> 00:11:44.253
un m'hot zey bald geharget, un der onfirer,

00:11:44.253 --> 00:11:47.451
a f- a rus fun Sibir, a fayner mentsh...

00:11:47.451 --> 00:11:50.020
di doktoyrim, iz nisht geven keyn NURSEn,

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:53.630
hobn zey geshlept oyf zikh tsen, fuftsn meter a soldat a farvundetn...

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:56.010
hot er ge⟨re⟩sn f- gerisn fun zikh di hor,

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:59.690
vos m'hot geshosn in zayne oygn di, di yidn.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.773
iz, ⟨hobn, hobn zey im⟩ genemen,

00:12:02.773 --> 00:12:06.511
un m'hot geharget di nayntsn froyen un mener yidn, nisht keyn NURSEn,

00:12:06.511 --> 00:12:09.523
un er hot dos gedenkt. az m'hot mikh gebrakht ahin,

00:12:09.523 --> 00:12:12.566
iz er gekumen nayntsn finef un fertsik mit a mishpet.

00:12:12.606 --> 00:12:17.520
nokh dem hot er nokh gedint, un nokh der milkhome ⟨hot men⟩ im gegebn vayl er iz geven in gefangenshaft, in plen.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.057
hot men im gegebn oykh tsen yor.

00:12:19.057 --> 00:12:22.720
iz er gekumen nayntsn finef un fertsik. mikh hot men gebrakht

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.331
nayntsn zeks un fertsik.

00:12:24.331 --> 00:12:28.280
iz nayntsn zeks un fertsik iz er geshtanen, ⟨un⟩ ven ikh bin arayngegangen in CONCENTRATION

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:30.285
zogt er, "ver bistu?" zog ikh, "ikh bin a yid."

00:12:30.325 --> 00:12:31.483
"kum aher."

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:35.620
hot er mir dertseylt di mayse, vi azoy, vi azoy di, m'hot geharget zayne yidn,

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:39.060
un er hot gezogt, "vi la-... ikh hob nisht gevust," er ken nisht keyn yidishe natsye.

00:12:39.268 --> 00:12:43.130
biz m'hot nisht geharget di yidn, hot er ni- er hot mit zey gearbet lange tsayt,

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:46.619
hot er nisht ge- geha- gevust vos s'heyst a y- a, a yid, a natsye.

00:12:46.761 --> 00:12:53.049
lebn Moskve iz do YAROSLAVL'., iz dort di goyim veysn nisht vegn y- vegn yid- vegn yidn.

00:12:53.342 --> 00:12:57.642
iz fl- az ikh fleg kumen fun vald... m'hot mikh gebrakht tsu firn tsuzamen mit andere...

00:12:57.642 --> 00:13:02.637
fleg er makhn froyen abortn, ⟨azoy me, azoy me, azoy me⟩ makht in dorf.

00:13:02.637 --> 00:13:05.641
nor s'iz nisht geven mit vos, keyn instrumentn, nor ⟨er iz a⟩ guter dokter.

00:13:05.641 --> 00:13:07.371
flegn zey brengen a bisl spirt,

00:13:07.371 --> 00:13:11.404
un er fleg mit, SOLIDOL, ⟨vo- dos,⟩ me shmirt di mashinen,

00:13:11.404 --> 00:13:13.180
a bisl kartofl opzharen

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.155
un er fleg mikh tsurufn un gebn mir esn.

00:13:15.432 --> 00:13:17.350
d- ale, di gantse tsayt.

00:13:17.524 --> 00:13:19.622
un az, m'hot geshribn,

00:13:19.622 --> 00:13:21.664
 protestn vegn mir,

00:13:21.664 --> 00:13:23.764
iz zenen zey in ergets nisht avekgegangen.

00:13:23.764 --> 00:13:27.440
der natshalnik funem lager iz gevezn Veler, a yid fun Belorusye.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.279
er hot zey nit avekgeshikt iber hoypt.

00:13:29.337 --> 00:13:32.240
un ven s'hot zikh shoyn geendikt zibn oder akht yor,

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.110
iz gevezn, farmishpet dokter ⟨Grakhe⟩,

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:37.054
vos er hot gesamt Maksim Gorki.

00:13:37.054 --> 00:13:39.104
er iz shoyn opgevezn di tsen yor,

00:13:39.104 --> 00:13:40.640
er iz shoyn geven fray,

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.150
iz er geforn keyn Moskve

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.711
zen zikh mit der mishpokhe.

00:13:43.711 --> 00:13:48.062
hot men im arayngerukt aza min protest un m'hot im gebetn in Moskve, er zol dos araynvarfn,

00:13:48.102 --> 00:13:49.499
un er hot dos getun.

00:13:49.499 --> 00:13:52.308
er hot gehat a yidishe froy. er iz shoyn geven fray.

00:13:52.308 --> 00:13:54.603
der doktor ⟨Grakhe⟩... er hot geheysn dokter ⟨Grakhe⟩...

00:13:54.603 --> 00:13:55.979
hot dos arayngevorfn,

00:13:55.979 --> 00:13:58.980
un eyne fun di ershte protestn nokh Stalin's toyt,

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.973
hot men UNK ibergekukt ⟨maynses⟩.

00:14:00.973 --> 00:14:04.470
ikh bin geven oyf a sosne, ge- gev- gezegt dem sosne far a,

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:08.000
⟨s- v-,⟩ far a groys ⟨volt⟩ stolb.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.217
shrayt UNK "krikh arop! bist fray." zog ikh, "meshugener,

00:14:11.217 --> 00:14:14.432
ikh darf nokh zitsn biz di, biz yanuar." s'iz geven detsember.

00:14:14.432 --> 00:14:16.540
kh'bin aropgekrokhn funem boym. zogt er,

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.116
"kum, bist bafrayt gevorn."

00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:21.814
un ikh bin bafrayt gevorn. ikh bin gegangen fertsn teg

00:14:21.814 --> 00:14:23.915
biz kh'hob getrofn ⟨dem⟩ Moyshe Shpritser,

00:14:23.915 --> 00:14:26.354
un mir zenen tsuzamen gekumen keyn Lemberik,

00:14:26.354 --> 00:14:30.270
un dernokh hob ikh opgevoynt akht un tsvontsik yor in Moskve.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.640
zey hobn mikh nit aroysgelozt.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.496
elef, ⟨b-⟩ elef, aynladungen

00:14:34.496 --> 00:14:36.479
fun Erets-Yisroel hot men mir nisht opgegebn.

00:14:36.479 --> 00:14:38.445
der tsvelefter iz ongekumen keyn ⟨LITAU⟩,

00:14:38.445 --> 00:14:40.368
hot mir gebrakht a litvishe froy,

00:14:40.368 --> 00:14:43.470
un a nes-min-hashomaim vos m'hot mikh aroysgelozt.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.794
kh'hob dokh nisht gehat dem konvert, dem ENVELOPE.

00:14:45.794 --> 00:14:48.266
"az m'hot nisht ⟨dem⟩ ENVELOPE, fun vanet hostu bakumen

00:14:48.266 --> 00:14:51.194
dem, di aynladung?" hot gefregt der KAGEBIST.

00:14:51.194 --> 00:14:54.786
hob ikh gezogt, "kh'hob gehat, nor zi, zi hot mir gornisht gezogt, dos shiksele, hob ikh tserisn."

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.390
genug fun dem. s'iz aroysgegangen der groyser natshalnik,

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.740
vos er iz gelegn mit mir in shpitol. zogt er tsu mir,

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:03.239
 "SHALOM," oyf rusish, "SHIMON"...

00:15:03.313 --> 00:15:06.457
a KAGEBIST. er iz geven mit mir in shpitol tsuzamen...

00:15:06.457 --> 00:15:09.984
az der hot gehert az er zogt mir, aza groyser mentsh, "SHALOM,"

00:15:09.984 --> 00:15:11.960
hot er, zogt er, "vos handlt zikh do?"

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:16.587
zogt er, "er hot nisht keyn ENVELOPE. me tor im nit aroyslozn." zogt er, "o, er iz a fayner mentsh! nem ⟨bay im⟩ on."

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.329
un azoy bin ikh aroysgeforn.

00:15:18.329 --> 00:15:21.853
mayn eydem iz gevorn religyez fun dens- fun yener tsayt,

00:15:21.859 --> 00:15:23.492
vayl er zogt, "got hot geholfn."

00:15:23.492 --> 00:15:25.560
un bizn hayntikn tog iz er religyez.

00:15:25.386 --> 00:15:27.690
un ven bistu gekumen in Amerike?

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.846
ikh bin gekumen keyn Amerike nayntsn tsvey un akhtsik

00:15:29.846 --> 00:15:32.403
in mart khoydesh. ⟨kh'bin⟩ gekumen aher

00:15:32.403 --> 00:15:34.880
vayl do... ikh hob gevolt forn keyn Erets-Yisroel,

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:38.731
un der ambasador in Italyen hot gevolt ge- ales meglekhes tun,

00:15:38.731 --> 00:15:40.750
vayl er hot geklungen keyn Yerusholaim,

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.759
un m'hot gezogt az s'iz der nomen in YAD BASHEM do,

00:15:43.759 --> 00:15:47.488
ABER mayn froy, mayn tokhter un mayn eydem hobn nisht gevolt forn.

00:15:47.488 --> 00:15:49.151
bin ikh gekumen aher

00:15:49.151 --> 00:15:51.210
un ikh bin in CHICAGO shoyn

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.041
fun nayntsn tsvey un akhtsik,

00:15:53.041 --> 00:15:55.083
un dos gantse lebn mayns

00:15:55.083 --> 00:15:57.015
shtreb ikh un denk,

00:15:57.015 --> 00:15:59.875
az ikh volt badarft zayn mit a shtik shvarts broyt,

00:15:59.875 --> 00:16:01.260
nor in Erets-Yisroel,

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.558
trots dem vos ikh bin dankbar Amerike, Amerike helft,

00:16:04.558 --> 00:16:07.207
ABER ikh hob badarft zayn... ikh hob opgegebn

00:16:07.207 --> 00:16:09.100
akht un draysik yor

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.090
asire-tsien: tsen yor

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:14.890
in Sibir, un akht un tsvontsik yor bin ikh gegangen yedn khoydesh

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:18.030
oyf der Lubyanke, zogn az ikh bin do, ikh bin nit avekgeforn.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.480
ikh hob gearbet, oysgegrobn beymer

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.850
far SPORT STATION. ikh hob gut fardint:

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:26.453
zibetsik rubl a tog in di tsvontsi- in di fuftsiker yorn

00:16:26.453 --> 00:16:28.200
⟨iz ekht⟩ geven zeyer groys.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.609
ikh hob gut gegesn.

00:16:29.609 --> 00:16:32.964
ikh bin gevorn bay fir un fertsik yor a man.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.089
ikh hob gevoygn finef un zekhtsik kilogram, hundert draysik f⟨UNK⟩nt.

00:16:36.089 --> 00:16:37.470
kh'hob khasene gehat

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.849
un kh'hob do a tokhter mit dray eyniklekh:

00:16:39.889 --> 00:16:42.856
Avrom, Libe un ⟨D-⟩ Daniel.

00:16:42.856 --> 00:16:44.389
dos iz mayn skhar,

00:16:44.479 --> 00:16:46.717
vos kh'hob getun far mayn folk.

00:16:46.842 --> 00:16:50.078
in CHICAGO batsien zikh tsu mir di mentshn zeyer fayn,

00:16:50.078 --> 00:16:53.190
un ⟨VOT s'⟩iz gekumen tsu mir zeyer a fayne froy PHYLLIS

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:55.723
un firt, makht mit mir dem,

00:16:55.723 --> 00:16:58.330
intervyu. es iz a groyse zakh

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.540
vos mir hobn bayn yidishn folk

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:05.010
aza min, vi, vi, der,

00:17:05.521 --> 00:17:09.760
v- aza min tayern yid velekher tut far⟨n,⟩ undzer folk

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:12.404
ot dos vos di mentshn zoln gevor vern

00:17:12.404 --> 00:17:14.496
vos dos yidish folk iz durkhgegangen.

00:17:14.496 --> 00:17:18.057
zol take lebn Shpilberg un tun di gute zakh vayter,

00:17:18.057 --> 00:17:19.922
un zol zayn khazak veemots.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:24.926
un mit dos, mir veln endikn. a groysn dank fun undz alemen.

00:17:25.165 --> 00:17:28.545
 ikh meyn, ikh, ikh vil endikn

00:17:28.545 --> 00:17:31.793
un dermit zogn a groysn yasher-koyekh un a groysn dank,

00:17:31.793 --> 00:17:34.434
 MRS. PHYLLIS un, mayn khaver,

00:17:34.434 --> 00:17:36.653
v- vos er shmuest mit mir loshn-koydesh,

00:17:36.653 --> 00:17:41.100
un danken di vos zey hobn, gebrakht dertsu,

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.496
un, kh'vil hofn

00:17:43.496 --> 00:17:47.765
az, mayne ibergelebte yorn veln gevor vern derfun oykh

00:17:47.765 --> 00:17:50.660
andere yidn, un shpetsyel rusishe yidn,

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.306
vos di poylishe yidn hobn getun far zey oykhet zeyer a sakh.

00:17:54.882 --> 00:17:56.749
dos iz mayn BABUSHKe.

00:17:56.805 --> 00:18:00.219
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn toyznt ⟨nayn⟩ hundert tsvontsik in Milnitse,

00:18:00.219 --> 00:18:03.627
ven ikh bin gekumen fun Kosev keyn Milnitse tsu voynen.

00:18:03.522 --> 00:18:05.001
un vi alt bistu?

00:18:06.289 --> 00:18:09.281
zi iz alt ariber nayntsik.

00:18:09.006 --> 00:18:10.063
un du?

00:18:09.636 --> 00:18:10.772
akht yor.

00:18:11.049 --> 00:18:12.049
⟨.⟩

00:18:11.115 --> 00:18:12.186
⟨-d iz ge-⟩...

00:18:12.482 --> 00:18:14.445
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn

00:18:14.445 --> 00:18:16.706
in toyznt nayn hundert zibn un tsvontsik,

00:18:16.706 --> 00:18:18.804
un ikh ken zikh nisht gefinen vu ikh bin.

00:18:20.633 --> 00:18:24.660
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn in toyznt nayn hundert zibn un tsvontsik

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.584
⟨in der⟩ hebreisher Tarbut shul.

00:18:28.328 --> 00:18:31.472
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn nokh der milkhome,

00:18:31.472 --> 00:18:34.433
ven ikh bin gekumen, bazukhn zey,

00:18:34.433 --> 00:18:37.985
zayendik fun Leningrad tsuriktsuforn keyn Poyln.

00:18:37.985 --> 00:18:41.714
rekhts mayn kuzen DAVID. er iz nifter geforn.

00:18:41.714 --> 00:18:43.188
in mitn ikh.

00:18:43.414 --> 00:18:46.609
 lebn mayn kuzen, zayn froy.

00:18:46.609 --> 00:18:51.643
LE-, links iz may- di kuzine mitn, kuzen, vos zey voynen in NEW YORK.

00:18:53.877 --> 00:18:56.500
oyf dem bild oyf links

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.712
iz der geshtorbener khaver mayner in Pariz,

00:18:59.712 --> 00:19:03.045
ARTUR Gold fun Lodzh, Avrom Gold fun Lodzh.

00:19:03.045 --> 00:19:04.755
lebn im, zayn froy,

00:19:05.132 --> 00:19:07.421
un ikh zits hintn.

00:19:07.545 --> 00:19:10.022
oyf rekhts, a sovyetisher ofitsir,

00:19:10.022 --> 00:19:14.407
a bruder fun a mishpokhe vos zey hobn undz geratevet in Rusland. zey hobn undz gegebn tsu esn.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.132
d- dos iz der dokument

00:19:19.257 --> 00:19:22.474
vos zey hobn aroysgegebn nokh akht a halb yor

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.144
in Sibir,

00:19:24.589 --> 00:19:27.908
bafrayung tsu forn keyn Milnitse.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.433
dos iz a, a dokument,

00:19:39.574 --> 00:19:42.470
nokh dem vi ikh bin opgezesn di ale yorn,

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:46.973
un nokh Stalin's toyt hobn zey mikh bafrayt, un zey zogn az ikh bin gornit shuldik.

00:19:48.315 --> 00:19:51.363
oyf dem bild bin ikh fotografirt mit mayn froy

00:19:48.326 --> 00:19:49.226
⟨sh!⟩

00:19:51.387 --> 00:19:54.216
un mit mayn kleyner tokhterl Khane

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:58.884
nokh dem, nokh UNK eyn yor tsayt nokh der khasene,

00:19:58.884 --> 00:20:02.265
in toyznt nayn hundert zibn u- zibn un fuftsik.

00:20:03.351 --> 00:20:05.339
dos iz MOSHE Shpritser,

00:20:05.339 --> 00:20:08.233
velkher iz farmishpet gevorn oykh oyf tsen yor

00:20:08.233 --> 00:20:10.300
far nemen onteyl in BRIKHA,

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:13.127
un dos iz di froy, fun, KOROSTYSHEV,

00:20:13.127 --> 00:20:15.613
Zhitomer OBLAST'. er hot mit ir khasene gehat.

00:20:15.872 --> 00:20:19.408
er hot mir dos bild geshikt keyn, keyn Moskve. ⟨er...⟩

00:20:19.821 --> 00:20:22.346
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn,

00:20:22.437 --> 00:20:25.378
vi di, mayn froy hot a freylekhn ponem

00:20:25.378 --> 00:20:27.934
un hot a sakh tayneg un nakhes,

00:20:27.934 --> 00:20:32.083
iz geboyrn gevorn undzer ershter, eynikl, Avromele.

00:20:32.359 --> 00:20:33.956
un vi heyst zi?

00:20:34.131 --> 00:20:36.208
 zi, Ester.

00:20:36.057 --> 00:20:37.057
Ester.

00:20:36.208 --> 00:20:37.358
Ester.

00:20:37.074 --> 00:20:38.899
un zi lebt yetst?

00:20:37.358 --> 00:20:40.369
⟨mayn froy⟩ Ester... NO, zi iz geshtorbn tsurik mit dray yor.

00:20:43.817 --> 00:20:47.490
itstert hob ikh dem koved tsu zitsn tsuzamen mit mayne kinder.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.358
fun links zitst mayn eydem ALEX.

00:20:50.517 --> 00:20:55.549
lebn im zitst, Avromele.

00:20:56.035 --> 00:21:00.107
dernokh, mit mir tsuzamen, zitst Danielku,

00:21:00.107 --> 00:21:03.099
un mit mayn tokhter Khanele zitst,

00:21:03.139 --> 00:21:06.980
 dos eynikl, undzer tayere LYUBA.

00:21:11.543 --> 00:21:14.844
azoy hob ikh di gantse mishpokhe tsuzamen mit mir.

00:21:37.914 --> 00:21:42.666
TELL US A LITTLE BIT ABOUT GROWING UP IN A HOUSE WITH SURVIVORS.

