00:26:55.928 --> 00:26:57.930
AND LUBA, Libe?

00:27:06.893 --> 00:27:08.006
AND Dani?

00:27:14.638 --> 00:27:16.180
AND YOU LIKE IT?

00:27:16.858 --> 00:27:18.966
