00:27:34.150 --> 00:27:36.152
YOU LIKE YOUR zeyde?

00:27:36.597 --> 00:27:38.459
AND THE LAST WORD.

00:27:39.499 --> 00:27:46.091
SO, I TH⟨I⟩NK F-, ikh UNK haynt iz far mir zeyer a fayner tog,

00:27:46.114 --> 00:27:47.728
a tog fun freyd,

00:27:48.190 --> 00:27:51.460
vos mayn tokhter un mayn eydem hobn gezogt

00:27:51.460 --> 00:27:55.052
