00:27:55.159 --> 00:27:57.559
es iz zeyer ayngenem, ⟨un⟩ got zol helfn

00:27:57.559 --> 00:28:02.192
az di bilder zoln brengen mazl, brokhe un hatslokhe der gantser mishpokhe,

00:28:02.192 --> 00:28:04.179
un aykh a groysn dank

00:28:04.179 --> 00:28:06.666
far ayer groyser mitsve vos ir hot getun.

00:28:06.666 --> 00:28:10.985
⟨ALEKHA, SHEHAYETA ALEKHA⟩ KOL TUV, VETODA RABA LEKHA.
